BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Practical AI: Using Gemini’s “Deep Research” to Contextualiz
 e your Research Project — Providence
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261104T120000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261104T125000
DTSTAMP:20261105T195953Z
UID:c0bc5526cac5eaebc71f8bb6ee47@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Lectures\, Seminars and Workshops\,Providence\,
 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hands-on workshop introducing Google Gemini’s 
 “Deep Research” as a tool of contextualizing your research project. Th
 is workshop will begin with a brief overview of what generative AI is and 
 what it is not. We will then discuss the usefulness of reference sources a
 s a starting place for academic research. Following these foundational mat
 ters\, we will have a hands-on activity where we use Gemini to generate cu
 stom reference sources with a key eye to the affordances and liabilities o
