CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Performances\, Concerts and Exhibitions\,Provid
 ence\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Poet/filmmaker Alystyre Julian’s OUTRIDER is a kinetic porta
 l into fast-speaking poet Anne Waldman’s transcendent role as a visionar
 y word-worker\, from her “hearthome” in Greenwich Village and The Poet
 ry Project at St. Mark’s Church\, to the Jack Kerouac School of Disembod
 ied Poetics at Naropa University in Boulder\, Colorado\, and outwards to B
 ig Sur\, Morocco\, and Mexico. From executive producer\, Martin Scorcese\,
  OUTRIDER is a portal to her path of imagination\, her vow to poetry and a
 ctivism\, and her vortex of artists/collaborators: Patti Smith\, Bob Dylan
 \, Thurston Moore\, Meredith Monk\, Allen Ginsberg\, Laurie Anderson\, Dou
 glas Dunn\, Eileen Myles\, Amiri Baraka\, James Brandon Lewis\, Cecilia Vi
 cu\nCategory: Performances\, Concerts and Exhibitions\nOriginal listing: h
 ttps://events.brown.edu/live/events/340676-outrider-a-film-by-alystyre-jul
 ian
