UID:857cb92a9fa83c2e04f8d0e817d1@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Art + Design\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:In this virtual studio\, young designers will explore how muse
 ums use graphic design to present historical information through exhibitio
 n graphics\, labels\, and promotional displays. Students will invent an an
 cient civilization or forgotten city\, develop its history and culture. Th
 ey’ll use Canva to create a poster or artifact label that introduces vis
 itors to their discovery. They will combine typography\, illustrations\, s
 ymbols\, maps\, and historical details to create a design that feels both 
 educational and imaginative. At the end of the studio\, students can share
  their work and receive feedback in a supportive environment.\nCategory: A
 rt + Design\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/graphic-desig
 n-studio-hidden-histories/
