DESCRIPTION:Bien vale un imperio is the second chapter of the Trilogía de
  la Edad de Plata Femenina (Trilogy of the Female Silver Age)\, a project 
 in which Paula Comitre builds a scenic triptych inspired by the imagery an
 d legacy of three key figures in the consolidation of flamenco and Spanish
  dance in the early 20th century. Following Après vous\, Madame —dedica
 ted to Antonia Mercé "La Argentina"—this new creation explores the figu
 re of Pastora Imperio. The trilogy will conclude with a third piece inspir
 ed by another icon of the era. Comitre uses the imagery and legacy of thes
 e women as a springboard for a fully contemporary creation that seeks not 
 to reconstruct the past\, but to activate it in the pres\nCategory: Multid
 isciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/
