UID:a18e86dabfc9bf10c4aac0e26a8f@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Music\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Join seven-time GRAMMY® Award nominee Nnenna Freelon for an i
 nspiring afternoon of conversation\, storytelling\, and live music at the 
 National Center for Civil and Human Rights. As part of her Atlanta residen
 cy\, Freelon will share insights from her acclaimed memoir\, Beneath the S
 kin of Sorrow: Improvisations on Loss\, and perform selections inspired by
  her recent album\, Beneath the Skin. Known for blending song\, personal r
 eflection\, and storytelling\, her appearances offer audiences a unique ex
 perience that is equal parts performance and discussion. This program is f
 ree with museum admission and will take place in Everyone. Everywhere. The
