DESCRIPTION:Join us for our upcoming Bioethics Interest Group Forum Hybrid
  Meeting to discuss Undocumented Populations and Access to Healthcare Acce
 ss to healthcare remains a significant challenge for many undocumented ind
 ividuals\, raising important ethical questions about justice\, human digni
 ty\, and the responsibilities of healthcare systems. Barriers related to i
 nsurance coverage\, immigration status\, fear of enforcement\, and social 
 determinants of health can limit access to essential medical services and 
 contribute to health disparities. This webinar will explore the ethical\, 
 legal\, and public health considerations surrounding healthcare access for
  undocumented populations\, examining how healthcare pr\nCategory: Academi
 c\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/big-forum-hybrid-meeti
 ng-undocumented-populations-and-access-to-healthcare
LOCATION:Milken Institute School of Public Health Building\, 950 New Hamps
 hire Avenue NW\, Washington DC 20052
STATUS:CONFIRMED
