STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/taiwan-conference-bilateral-ballot-boxe
 s-us-midterms-taiwans-local-elections-and-policy-trajectories
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:gwu-arts
END:VEVENT
