 mental theatre performance devised by local artists titled F*CK THIS\, I
 ’M GOING TO CHURCH taking place at Virginia-Highland Church every weeken
 d of March. March 06 – March 28\, 2026 Fridays at 8:00pm Saturdays at 3:
 00pm and 7:00pm F*CK THIS\, I’M GOING TO CHURCH is an immersive\, experi
 mental theatre experience that reclaims the idea of church as loving commu
 nity\, rejecting religious dogma that preaches shame\, judgment\, oppressi
